设 \(A = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & -2 & 3 \\ 0 & 1 & -1 \\ 1 & 2 & 0 \end{pmatrix}, \beta = \begin{pmatrix} -4 \\ 1 \\ -3 \end{pmatrix}, B = \begin{pmatrix} -2 & 1 & 3 \\ 1 & 0 & -1 \\ 2 & 1 & 0 \end{pmatrix}, (A, \beta) = BC.\)
(1) 求 Ax = β 的解, 并求出 C;
